  "created": "2025-12-18T14:09:00.657Z",
  "description": "The Forsign SDK was developed as a robust and flexible solution for seamlessly\n      integrating\n      digital electronic signature functionality into .NET applications. Forsign is renowned for its\n      advanced electronic signature platform, offering a variety of signature types, adaptable\n      workflows, dynamic forms for filling out, and an exceptional user experience. This .NET SDK is\n      designed to simplify the integration process, enabling developers to quickly implement complex\n      digital signature features into their own applications.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "ForSign.Sdk",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-12-18T14:12:07.343Z",
